# The blur bridge is built, never committed. wayland-scanner regenerates the
# protocol glue and build.sh compiles the library, both from sources that are
# tracked — so the repository stays portable and a delivered folder can still
# carry the compiled result for the machine it was built on.
kairo/qt/native/libkairoblur.so
kairo/qt/native/ext-background-effect-v1-client-protocol.h
kairo/qt/native/ext-background-effect-v1-protocol.c
